title: "A brief pulse. A broad transcriptional signature: psilocin human-neuron transcriptomics"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22843281
date-released: 2026-09-19
abstract: "An independent secondary analysis of the Schmidt et al. (2026) human-neuron experiment and its public data. This research object contains newly generated reproducibility code, frozen specifications, derived tables, figures, tests, and an interactive atlas; it is not the original experimental dataset or the original Hoffrichter/Schmidt analysis."
